{"seq":1,"slug":"fraud-detection","title":"支付欺诈检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/risk-and-fraud/fraud-detection","wordCount":1368,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"支付欺诈检测\">支付欺诈检测</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>支付欺诈每年给全球电商造成超过 400 亿美元的损失。欺诈检测是在不影响正常用户体验的前提下，识别和拦截恶意交易。现代欺诈检测系统融合规则引擎、机器学习模型和实时行为分析，在毫秒级响应窗口内做出准确判断。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[交易请求] --&gt; B[数据采集层]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[设备指纹]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[行为数据]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[交易属性]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[历史画像]&#10;    B1 --&gt; C[风险评估引擎]&#10;    B2 --&gt; C&#10;    B3 --&gt; C&#10;    B4 --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D{风险等级}&#10;    D --&gt;|低风险| E[直接通过]&#10;    D --&gt;|中风险| F[增强验证]&#10;    D --&gt;|高风险| G[拦截/人工审核]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[3DS 验证]&#10;    F --&gt; F2[OTP 验证]&#10;    F --&gt; F3[人脸识别]\">graph TB\n    A[交易请求] --&gt; B[数据采集层]\n    B --&gt; B1[设备指纹]\n    B --&gt; B2[行为数据]\n    B --&gt; B3[交易属性]\n    B --&gt; B4[历史画像]\n    B1 --&gt; C[风险评估引擎]\n    B2 --&gt; C\n    B3 --&gt; C\n    B4 --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D{风险等级}\n    D --&gt;|低风险| E[直接通过]\n    D --&gt;|中风险| F[增强验证]\n    D --&gt;|高风险| G[拦截/人工审核]\n    F --&gt; F1[3DS 验证]\n    F --&gt; F2[OTP 验证]\n    F --&gt; F3[人脸识别]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>欺诈类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>占比</th>\n<th>检测难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>盗卡欺诈</td>\n<td>使用窃取的卡信息</td>\n<td>40%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账户接管</td>\n<td>盗取用户登录凭证</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>友好欺诈</td>\n<td>真实持卡人恶意拒付</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>身份欺诈</td>\n<td>使用虚假身份开户</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款欺诈</td>\n<td>虚假退货/退款申请</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"设备指纹与行为分析\">设备指纹与行为分析</h2><p>设备指纹（Device Fingerprinting）通过采集浏览器/设备的技术特征组合来唯一标识一台设备，即使用户更换 IP 地址或清除 Cookie 也能追踪。采集的信号包括：User-Agent、屏幕分辨率、时区、已安装字体、WebGL 渲染器、Canvas 指纹、AudioContext 指纹等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DeviceFingerprint {&#10;  fingerprintId: string;&#10;  confidence: number;&#10;  signals: {&#10;    userAgent: string;&#10;    screenResolution: string;&#10;    timezone: string;&#10;    language: string;&#10;    platform: string;&#10;    webglRenderer: string;&#10;    canvasHash: string;&#10;    audioHash: string;&#10;    installedPlugins: string[];&#10;    touchSupport: boolean;&#10;    colorDepth: number;&#10;    hardwareConcurrency: number;&#10;  };&#10;  riskIndicators: {&#10;    isVPN: boolean;&#10;    isProxy: boolean;&#10;    isTor: boolean;&#10;    isEmulator: boolean;&#10;    isBot: boolean;&#10;    isIncognito: boolean;&#10;    ipGeolocationMismatch: boolean;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DeviceFingerprint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fingerprintId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  confidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  signals</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    userAgent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    screenResolution</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    timezone</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    language</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    platform</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    webglRenderer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    canvasHash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    audioHash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    installedPlugins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    touchSupport</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    colorDepth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    hardwareConcurrency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  riskIndicators</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    isVPN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    isProxy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    isTor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    isEmulator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    isBot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    isIncognito</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ipGeolocationMismatch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>行为生物识别（Behavioral Biometrics）分析用户在页面上的交互模式——打字节奏、鼠标移动轨迹、滑动速度、点击力度等。这些特征像指纹一样独特，难以被机器人或欺诈者模仿。当检测到行为模式偏离历史基线时（如突然从中国变为美国 IP、打字速度异常快），系统触发增强验证。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>行为信号</th>\n<th>正常用户特征</th>\n<th>欺诈者/机器人特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>页面停留时间</td>\n<td>30秒-5分钟</td>\n<td>&lt;5秒或非常一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鼠标轨迹</td>\n<td>自然曲线</td>\n<td>直线或无移动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表单填写</td>\n<td>逐字段填写，有修改</td>\n<td>一次性粘贴所有字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打字间隔</td>\n<td>变化的节奏</td>\n<td>极度均匀的间隔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页面浏览路径</td>\n<td>多页浏览后结账</td>\n<td>直达支付页面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"规则引擎\">规则引擎</h2><p>规则引擎是欺诈检测的第一道防线，通过预定义的条件逻辑快速过滤明显的欺诈交易。规则通常基于领域专家的经验制定，覆盖金额阈值、频率限制、地理围栏和黑名单匹配等维度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FraudRule {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  priority: number;&#10;  enabled: boolean;&#10;  conditions: {&#10;    field: string;&#10;    operator: &#39;eq&#39; | &#39;gt&#39; | &#39;lt&#39; | &#39;in&#39; | &#39;not_in&#39; | &#39;regex&#39;;&#10;    value: string | number | string[];&#10;  }[];&#10;  conditionLogic: &#39;AND&#39; | &#39;OR&#39;;&#10;  action: &#39;block&#39; | &#39;review&#39; | &#39;challenge&#39; | &#39;allow&#39;;&#10;  score: number;&#10;  metadata: {&#10;    author: string;&#10;    reason: string;&#10;    lastModified: number;&#10;    falsePositiveRate?: number;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;const COMMON_FRAUD_RULES: FraudRule[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    id: &#39;r001&#39;,&#10;    name: &#39;单卡高频交易&#39;,&#10;    priority: 1,&#10;    enabled: true,&#10;    conditions: [{ field: &#39;card_transactions_1h&#39;, operator: &#39;gt&#39;, value: 5 }],&#10;    conditionLogic: &#39;AND&#39;,&#10;    action: &#39;block&#39;,&#10;    score: 80,&#10;    metadata: { author: &#39;risk-team&#39;, reason: &#39;盗卡试探&#39;, lastModified: Date.now() },&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    id: &#39;r002&#39;,&#10;    name: &#39;地址IP不匹配&#39;,&#10;    priority: 2,&#10;    enabled: true,&#10;    conditions: [&#10;      { field: &#39;billing_country&#39;, operator: &#39;not_in&#39;, value: [&#39;ip_country&#39;] },&#10;      { field: &#39;amount&#39;, operator: &#39;gt&#39;, value: 500 },&#10;    ],&#10;    conditionLogic: &#39;AND&#39;,&#10;    action: &#39;review&#39;,&#10;    score: 60,&#10;    metadata: { author: &#39;risk-team&#39;, reason: &#39;跨境风险&#39;, lastModified: Date.now() },&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FraudRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  priority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  enabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  conditions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span styl